.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.1075,"r5":-0.1613,"r20":-0.2652,"r1_spy":-0.1023,"r5_spy":-0.1684,"r20_spy":-0.2022}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SLM 2017 Q4","e":"slm","d":"2018-01-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve McGarry","x":"If there is in fact a budget reconciliation bill at some point in time in 2018, the HEA reauthorization could actually be passed through given the current composition of the senate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/01/18/sallie-mae-corporation-slm-q4-2017-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2018 Q3","e":"slm","d":"2018-10-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Steve McGarry","x":"And credit card is very much a direct-to-consumer marketing game.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/slm-corp-slm-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2018 Q3","e":"slm","d":"2018-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve McGarry","x":"So the key contributors toward raising guidance for the final quarter a year here was credit two-thirds, NIM, a third.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/slm-corp-slm-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2019 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ray Quinlan","x":"And so we actually -- had we not had this TDR accounting sort of impact, we would have increased our guidance and all likelihood, as we have done in prior years, tightening up the guidance at the first half of the year that would've been up by $0.015 or so on the low end, about $0.01 on the high…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/slm-slm-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2019 Q3","e":"slm","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ray Quinlan","x":"And as we've discussed in prior calls, we expect the NIM to continue to drift on down, but is a pass-through largely with no EPS impact as we increase the liquidity on the balance sheet to be more in line with some industry norms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/slm-slm-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q1","e":"slm","d":"2020-04-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Steve McGarry","x":"We have seen a number of direct-to-consumer, pay-per-click banner type of players significantly drop their spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/25/slm-slm-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q1","e":"slm","d":"2020-04-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Steve McGarry","x":"And as you may recall, last quarter, there was enormous pressure on the direct-to-consumer market, so we think that we will manage our direct-to-consumer spend a lot more carefully in the peak season.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/25/slm-slm-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q1","e":"slm","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve McGarry","x":"But I think from a cost-cutting perspective, we're not really going to be doing anything that even remotely approaches harming our core business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/25/slm-slm-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2020-07-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"First of all, I think we've always had a good blend of sales force and direct-to-consumer and we've certainly talked in past quarters about sort of the enhanced capabilities and investments that we're making in the direct-to-consumer side of things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2020-07-23","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Kaye","x":"It seems that Sallie Mae is much more sales force-driven, while Discover is more focused on direct-to-consumer marketing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2020-07-23","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Kaye","x":"Perhaps you need to lean harder on direct-to-consumer marketing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q4","e":"slm","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"Additionally, we implemented a $50 million reduction to our expense base in '21 and future years as a result of the restructuring efforts we announced last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/sallie-mae-slm-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2020 Q4","e":"slm","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven J. McGarry","x":"Few words on opex, 2020 operating expenses excluding restructuring fees were $538 million compared to $574 million for 2019, 6% lower.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/sallie-mae-slm-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q1","e":"slm","d":"2021-04-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"As we've talked about in a number of calls before, we continue to invest, we think, very effectively in our direct-to-consumer marketing efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/slm-corp-slm-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q1","e":"slm","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven J. McGarry","x":"This is obviously driven by the sharp cost reductions generated by our Q3 2020 restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/slm-corp-slm-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q1","e":"slm","d":"2021-04-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"Therefore, we'd like to update and reaffirm our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/slm-corp-slm-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"I think we do see pretty strong competitive intensity in the marketing, especially direct-to-consumer space, but that's not unique to student lending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"I think, in general, any B2C business right now we're seeing frisky competition in the direct-to-consumer space as everyone is buying for the kind of growth coming out of the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Steven J. McGarry","x":"I believe that, that was a direct-to-consumer loan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"At the end of the day, our aspiration has never been to compete with Am Ex or Citibank or JPMorgan or Capital One in the broad sort of direct-to-consumer unbranded sort of card space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"My guess is, we will become slightly less focused on share repurchases as, hopefully, the stock price increases and this arbitrage begins to narrow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"…well, my hope is we start to become not the cheapest neo bank out there, but still the most affordable neo bank out there, Jordan, but we certainly agree with you in the importance of marketing and your sort of statement that we're improving as high praise, and I will pass that on to the team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven J. McGarry","x":"However, based on continued strong performance, we did reduce our outlook for expected defaults, as you saw in our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2021-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Witter","x":"Therefore, we would like to update and reaffirm our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/sallie-mae-slm-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2021 Q3","e":"slm","d":"2021-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven J. McGarry","x":"Based on continued strong performance, we reduced our outlook for expected defaults, as you saw in our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/sallie-mae-slm-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2025 Q2","e":"slm","d":"2025-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Peter Graham","x":"And that gives us confidence in our sort of longer-term journey and gives us confidence in terms of reaffirming our guidance for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/slm-slm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SLM 2026 Q3","e":"slm","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Graham","x":"On October 1, we executed a restructuring plan to better align resources with the company's strategic priorities, improve operating efficiency.","u